igns that demand precision and timing. Compete for the fastest times in intense time trials, unlock fresh cosmetics to customize your gorilla, and stand out while you climb. Join a growing community of players and creators, and with regular updates adding new maps, features, and surprises, Gorilla Heights 2 keeps things fresh while you take in the crazy views at the top! if you can even make it up there.", "short_description": "Gorilla Heights 2 takes your favorite gorilla movement to even crazier heights! \ud83e\uddd7\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Explore brand-new, vertically insane maps built to push your climbing skills to the limit. Swing faster, climb smarter, and challenge your friends to reach the highest peaks ever seen. Discover secret routes, advanced movement tech, and wild new areas that weren\u2019t possible before. Whether you're speedrunning to the top or just vibing with friends, every climb hits different."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/gorillaheights/privacy-policy-2", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Kraken Kreations", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/gorillaheights/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "27158354457099361"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square